-- Parity fixture: a permission (MAY) whose window has not closed is still
-- waiting, on jl4-service as on the WASM runtime; it is FULFILLED only once
-- its deadline has passed unused, and its HENCE applies only if it is used.

DECLARE Party IS ONE OF `the holder`, `the issuer`
DECLARE `Option Action` IS ONE OF `exercise the option`, `pay the strike`, `send a notice`

@export default an option the holder may exercise within 10, then pay within 5
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `Option Action`
`option contract` MEANS
    PARTY `the holder`
    MAY `exercise the option`
    WITHIN 10
    HENCE
        PARTY `the holder`
        MUST `pay the strike`
        WITHIN 5
